UR(a){return"D\xfc\u015ft\xfc\u011f\xfcnde ya\u015fayan t\xfcm m\xfcttefikleri maks. <hp>canlar\u0131n\u0131n</hp> %"+a+" oran\u0131nda <fx:heal>iyile\u015ftirir</fx> ve t\xfcm [!zay\u0131flatmalar\u0131n\u0131!] kald\u0131r\u0131r. Tam <hp>can\u0131</hp> a\u015fan k\u0131s\u0131m <fx:shield>kalkan</fx> olur. Sava\u015fta bir kez."},
